Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, subparagraph 2b of Appendix 2, subparagraph 25 of subparagraph 2a of Appendix 3, subparagraph 2a of Appendix 3, subparagraph 2a through subparagraph 26 of Appendix 3, with the exception of items a through ad, subparagraph 17 of subparagraph 1 of Appendix 5, and Appendix 6; The amended provisions of subparagraph 2j,l and p shall enter into force on April 25, 2018.
